Personas (CC BY-NC 4.0)
  The personas and their memory statements in profiles.json are adapted from CIMemories
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/facebook/CIMemories; Mireshghallah et al., "CIMemories: A Compositional Benchmark
  for Contextual Integrity of Persistent Memory in LLMs", arXiv:2511.14937), licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0. They were
  modified for this benchmark.

Sensitive statements (NVIDIA License, non-commercial)
  The sensitive statements are derivative works of records in Privasis-Zero
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Privasis-Zero), released under the NVIDIA License, a copy of which is in
  LICENSE-Privasis-Zero. The following files contain these derivative works and are subject to the use limitation in
  Section 3.3 of the NVIDIA License (non-commercial use only, i.e. research or evaluation purposes only), in addition
  to CC BY-NC 4.0:
    statements.json
    statements_unnamed.json
    statements_declaration.json
    constraints.json and need_labels.json (constraints and required content derived from these statements)
